{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During the softball season, Judy had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> hits.  Among her hits were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> home run, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> triple and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> doubles.  The rest of her hits were single.  What percent of her hits were single?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c55ffcf7edad33732f0cbe8c5d94f200440bd7e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 28\\% \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 35\\% \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 70\\% \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 75\\% \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"451\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the information given, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae2592d15419b3c26e0e84e7e8035540bb3fb0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35-5-1-1=28$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"154\" height=\"13\" /> hits were single.  Thus, the percentage was\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f4862ce38acea735c7c795c13c6e5ad84c76f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{28}{35}=80\\% \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{E}}.\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME\" title=\"1992 AJHSME\">1992 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-alig